<p>AKBAR MUJHE ABBAS KE LAASHE PA LE CHALO</p>

<p>CHEHRA MERE BHAI KA BAS EK BAAR DIKHADO</p>

<p>1. PAALA HAI MAINE USKO MERE LAAL KI TARHA<br>
BATTEES BARAS KA HUA MUJHSE PISAR JUDA<br>
MUJHKO MERE JAWAAN KE LAASHE PA LE CHALO</p>

<p>AKBAR MUJHE ABBAS KE LAASHE PA LE CHALO</p>

<p>
2. SUNKAR SALAAM GHAZI KA YE DIL MACHAL GAYA<br>
TOOTI KAMAR KO THAAM KE BOLE SHAHE HUDA<br>
KHAIME ME JAAKE YE MERI ZAINAB KO SUNAADO</p>

<p>AKBAR MUJHE ABBAS KE LAASHE PA LE CHALO</p>

<p>3. AKBAR MUJHE MAIDAAN ME LEKAR CHALO BETA<br>
GHODE SE GIRA SANIYE HYDER CHALO BETA<br>
LAASHE KE PAAS MUJHKO MERE LAAL BITHADO</p>

<p>AKBAR MUJHE ABBAS KE LAASHE PA LE CHALO</p>

<p>4. JO HATH AAPNE MERE HATHO ME DIYE THE<br>
BABA MERE ABBAS KE WO HATH KAT GAYE<br>
BAAZU UTHAAKE YE MERI ANKHO'N SE LAGAADO</p>

<p>AKBAR MUJHE ABBAS KE LAASHE PA LE CHALO</p>

<p>5.&#160; ZAQMO SE CHOOR DEKHKE ABBAS KA LAASHA<br>
SARWAR NE TADAPKAR KAR ALI AKBAR SE YE KAHA<br>
BETA CHACHA KO TEER SE BHALO'N SE NIKAALO</p>

<p>AKBAR MUJHE ABBAS KE LAASHE PA LE CHALO</p>

<p>6. ABBAS SE HUSSAIN NE PHIR ROKE YE KAHA<br>
KHWAAHISH HAI MERI AAPSE AYE JAANE MURTAZA<br>
EK BAAR IS GHAREEB KO BHAI TO PUKAARO</p>

<p>AKBAR MUJHE ABBAS KE LAASHE PA LE CHALO</p>

<p>
7. AMMAR SAIF JAB KE ALAM RAN SE AAGAYA <br>
KHAIMO ME GHUL UTHA KE ALAMDAAR MARGAYA<br>
ZAINAB NE KAHA TAB ALI AKBAR SE YE RO RO</p>

<p>AKBAR MUJHE ABBAS KE LAASHE PA LE CHALO</p>